{"id":"cue-0-4720","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-4720","source_start_seconds":4.72,"source_end_seconds":6.34,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.62,"text":"将军帽又叫甲鲍鱼"}
{"id":"cue-1-6340","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-4720","source_start_seconds":6.34,"source_end_seconds":9.14,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.8,"text":"它是跟鲍鱼非常像的一种海鲜"}
{"id":"cue-2-13590","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-2-13590","source_start_seconds":13.59,"source_end_seconds":13.95,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.36,"text":"大家好"}
{"id":"cue-3-13950","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-2-13590","source_start_seconds":13.95,"source_end_seconds":14.63,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.68,"text":"我是小马"}
{"id":"cue-4-14630","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-2-13590","source_start_seconds":14.63,"source_end_seconds":16.45,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.82,"text":"前两天咱们做的螺丝粉"}
{"id":"cue-5-16450","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-2-13590","source_start_seconds":16.45,"source_end_seconds":18.15,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.7,"text":"我和卡哥都觉得特别好吃"}
{"id":"cue-6-18150","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-2-13590","source_start_seconds":18.15,"source_end_seconds":20.13,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.98,"text":"今天要给他来一个升级版的"}
{"id":"cue-7-20130","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-2-13590","source_start_seconds":20.13,"source_end_seconds":22.19,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.06,"text":"先到海边来抓一种海鲜"}
{"id":"cue-8-22190","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-8-22190","source_start_seconds":22.19,"source_end_seconds":23.01,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.82,"text":"对了"}
{"id":"cue-9-23010","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-8-22190","source_start_seconds":23.01,"source_end_seconds":24.67,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.66,"text":"这个螺丝粉其实性价比非常高"}
{"id":"cue-10-24670","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-8-22190","source_start_seconds":24.67,"source_end_seconds":26.19,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.52,"text":"大家想吃的话可以试一试"}
{"id":"cue-11-26190","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-8-22190","source_start_seconds":26.19,"source_end_seconds":28.21,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.02,"text":"要抓的海鲜就在这下面"}
{"id":"cue-12-28210","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-8-22190","source_start_seconds":28.21,"source_end_seconds":29.75,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.54,"text":"等潮水退了就看见了"}
{"id":"cue-13-29750","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-8-22190","source_start_seconds":29.75,"source_end_seconds":30.61,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.86,"text":"老师有朋友说"}
{"id":"cue-14-30610","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-14-30610","source_start_seconds":30.61,"source_end_seconds":32.09,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.48,"text":"咱们吃的海鲜太便宜了"}
{"id":"cue-15-32090","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-14-30610","source_start_seconds":32.09,"source_end_seconds":33.13,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.04,"text":"今天就来点硬货"}
{"id":"cue-16-33130","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-14-30610","source_start_seconds":33.13,"source_end_seconds":34.53,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.4,"text":"海鲜鲍鱼大虾"}
{"id":"cue-17-34530","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-14-30610","source_start_seconds":34.53,"source_end_seconds":36.91,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.38,"text":"因为家里头鲍鱼没有存过了"}
{"id":"cue-18-37570","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-18-37570","source_start_seconds":37.57,"source_end_seconds":39.69,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.12,"text":"咱们就到海边来摳点将军帽"}
{"id":"cue-19-39690","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-18-37570","source_start_seconds":39.69,"source_end_seconds":40.95,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.26,"text":"这个也叫甲鲍鱼"}
{"id":"cue-20-40950","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-18-37570","source_start_seconds":40.95,"source_end_seconds":42.09,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.14,"text":"其实差不多的"}
{"id":"cue-21-60070","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-21-60070","source_start_seconds":60.07,"source_end_seconds":60.95,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.88,"text":"我的妈呀"}
{"id":"cue-22-60950","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-21-60070","source_start_seconds":60.95,"source_end_seconds":62.35,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.4,"text":"这是一无二呀"}
{"id":"cue-23-69390","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-23-69390","source_start_seconds":69.39,"source_end_seconds":70.39,"speaking_duration_seconds":1,"text":"拿三个"}
{"id":"cue-24-72930","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-24-72930","source_start_seconds":72.93,"source_end_seconds":73.87,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.94,"text":"将军帽的肉"}
{"id":"cue-25-73870","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-24-72930","source_start_seconds":73.87,"source_end_seconds":76.49,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.62,"text":"它是和鲍鱼的肉是非常非常像的"}
{"id":"cue-26-78400","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-26-78400","source_start_seconds":78.4,"source_end_seconds":79.36,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.96,"text":"做两碗螺丝粉"}
{"id":"cue-27-79360","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-26-78400","source_start_seconds":79.36,"source_end_seconds":80.44,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.08,"text":"这么多肯定是够了"}
{"id":"cue-28-80440","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-26-78400","source_start_seconds":80.44,"source_end_seconds":81.48,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.04,"text":"现在有点长潮了"}
{"id":"cue-29-82460","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-29-82460","source_start_seconds":82.46,"source_end_seconds":84.06,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.6,"text":"咱们先生活把分煮一下"}
{"id":"cue-30-89420","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-30-89420","source_start_seconds":89.42,"source_end_seconds":91.36,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.94,"text":"这个是咱们团队的新成员"}
{"id":"cue-31-91360","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-30-89420","source_start_seconds":91.36,"source_end_seconds":91.88,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.52,"text":"萧小咪"}
{"id":"cue-32-91880","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-30-89420","source_start_seconds":91.88,"source_end_seconds":93.7,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.82,"text":"前两天在路边发现的"}
{"id":"cue-33-93700","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-30-89420","source_start_seconds":93.7,"source_end_seconds":95.16,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.46,"text":"这是刚刚吃饭不久"}
{"id":"cue-34-96480","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-96480","source_start_seconds":96.48,"source_end_seconds":98.06,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.58,"text":"这不会吃啊光甜"}
{"id":"cue-35-101840","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-35-101840","source_start_seconds":101.84,"source_end_seconds":103.06,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.22,"text":"这是今天准备的海鲜"}
{"id":"cue-36-103060","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-35-101840","source_start_seconds":103.06,"source_end_seconds":103.82,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.76,"text":"两只海鲜"}
{"id":"cue-37-103820","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-35-101840","source_start_seconds":103.82,"source_end_seconds":104.5,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.68,"text":"四只虾"}
{"id":"cue-38-104500","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-35-101840","source_start_seconds":104.5,"source_end_seconds":105.64,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.14,"text":"还有一些假鲍鱼"}
{"id":"cue-39-126260","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-39-126260","source_start_seconds":126.26,"source_end_seconds":128.46,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.2,"text":"今天还是请卡哥过来尝一尝"}
{"id":"cue-40-128460","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-39-126260","source_start_seconds":128.46,"source_end_seconds":130.9,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.44,"text":"卡哥对吃这一块还是比较了解的"}
{"id":"cue-41-134380","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-41-134380","source_start_seconds":134.38,"source_end_seconds":137.18,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.8,"text":"这个粉煮的比前两天咱们煮的那个要好"}
{"id":"cue-42-137180","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-41-134380","source_start_seconds":137.18,"source_end_seconds":139.36,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.18,"text":"前两天煮的时候没加凉水泡"}
{"id":"cue-43-139360","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-41-134380","source_start_seconds":139.36,"source_end_seconds":141.12,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.76,"text":"这个加凉水泡了一下"}
{"id":"cue-44-141120","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-41-134380","source_start_seconds":141.12,"source_end_seconds":145.57,"speaking_duration_seconds":4.45,"text":"就格外就弹大虾"}
{"id":"cue-45-146270","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-45-146270","source_start_seconds":146.27,"source_end_seconds":148.35,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.08,"text":"反正这个海鲜味道也融洁"}
{"id":"cue-46-150560","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-46-150560","source_start_seconds":150.56,"source_end_seconds":151.54,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.98,"text":"海鲜"}
{"id":"cue-47-152900","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-47-152900","source_start_seconds":152.9,"source_end_seconds":153.88,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.98,"text":"我已经吃了"}
{"id":"cue-48-157520","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-157520","source_start_seconds":157.52,"source_end_seconds":159.06,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.54,"text":"这将军帽煮完就缩了"}
{"id":"cue-49-159060","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-157520","source_start_seconds":159.06,"source_end_seconds":159.82,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.76,"text":"就缩这么一点"}
{"id":"cue-50-161040","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-50-161040","source_start_seconds":161.04,"source_end_seconds":162.6,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.56,"text":"它的口感跟鲍鱼很像"}
{"id":"cue-51-162600","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-50-161040","source_start_seconds":162.6,"source_end_seconds":163.48,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.88,"text":"只剥小一点"}
{"id":"cue-52-163480","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-50-161040","source_start_seconds":163.48,"source_end_seconds":164.52,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.04,"text":"所以说叫假鲍鱼"}
{"id":"cue-53-165200","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-53-165200","source_start_seconds":165.2,"source_end_seconds":166.58,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.38,"text":"这一碗放在外面卖"}
{"id":"cue-54-166580","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-53-165200","source_start_seconds":166.58,"source_end_seconds":167.78,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.2,"text":"估计怎么也得100吧"}
{"id":"cue-55-167780","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-53-165200","source_start_seconds":167.78,"source_end_seconds":170.16,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.38,"text":"这一碗关键是没有什么卖的呀"}
{"id":"cue-56-170160","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-53-165200","source_start_seconds":170.16,"source_end_seconds":171.68,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.52,"text":"关键主要是没这么做的"}
{"id":"cue-57-172880","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-57-172880","source_start_seconds":172.88,"source_end_seconds":173.76,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.88,"text":"全是硬货"}
{"id":"cue-58-173760","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-57-172880","source_start_seconds":173.76,"source_end_seconds":175.54,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.78,"text":"超级无敌奢侈"}
{"id":"cue-59-175540","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-57-172880","source_start_seconds":175.54,"source_end_seconds":177.44,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.9,"text":"海鲜大虾螺丝粉"}
{"id":"cue-60-177980","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-57-172880","source_start_seconds":177.98,"source_end_seconds":179.68,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.7,"text":"我这一碗连汤都喝完了"}
{"id":"cue-61-180080","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-57-172880","source_start_seconds":180.08,"source_end_seconds":180.58,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.5,"text":"过瘾"}
